Bot1.Battlefield = Mox Jet
Bot2.Battlefield = Mox Emerald; Mox Ruby; Forest
Bot1.Graveyard = Rite of Replication; Black Lotus
Bot2.Graveyard = Llanowar Elves; Lightning Bolt
